{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20992","headline":"拂舞歌辞 · 李贺","name":"拂舞歌辞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴娥声绝天，空云闲裴回。\n门外满车马，亦须生绿苔。\n尊有乌程酒，劝君千万寿。\n全胜汉武锦楼上，晓望晴寒饮花露。\n东方日不破，天光无老时。\n丹成作蛇乘白雾，千年重化玉井土。\n从蛇作土一千载，吴堤绿草年年在。\n背有八卦称神仙，邪鳞顽甲滑腥涎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20992.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20992","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}